id: ANN-NEXT-SPELLING
family: annotations
status: known-issue
expect: accept
command: run
output: Nexter Colony: system/net
reference: impl/frontend/parser.cpp (parseAnnotation)
note: The parser joins an annotation's tokens with single spaces, so the forwarded destination reads 'system / net' instead of 'system/net'. The safety check now ignores the spaces; the stored value is still the spaced text.
